      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't personally use an Xbox controller but I felt I should add to this. \nFirst, this is a wonderful idea to be supported natively in VRChat. Unity is pretty good about alternative input methods in games regarding controllers (both VR and non-vr)\nSecond, to the OP, I would recommend looking into the button mappings in steam (did you know *you* can reprogram the mappings in big picture mode?!) Or alternatively a more advanced system like joyToKey or glovePIE. There are definitely some options out there~\n\nHave a great day and happy mapping!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
